<h2 class="neighbor-card__name">Single mother, two young children · Strawberry Mansion</h2>
<p class="neighbor-card__area">North/Northwest Core</p>
</header>
<p class="neighbor-card__facts">$0–$8,000 annually after job loss · two children · TANF + SNAP + Medicaid</p>
<p class="neighbor-card__insight">PA Group 2 TANF at $403 per month supports the family at approximately 22% of the federal poverty threshold. The 60-month lifetime clock starts at first benefit issuance. Cash benefit plus categorical Medicaid coverage, but the benefit level does not cover basic shelter cost in the Philadelphia rental market.</p>
