<h2 class="neighbor-card__name">Disabled adult, age 52 · West Philadelphia</h2>
<p class="neighbor-card__area">West Philadelphia Core</p>
</header>
<p class="neighbor-card__facts">22-year covered-work history · SSDI application pending · back injury, sedentary RFC denial</p>
<p class="neighbor-card__insight">Initial denial, reconsideration denied, ALJ hearing scheduled with a 12-month wait. The 18-to-24-month pipeline runs without SSDI or SSI cash income; no automatic Medicaid for adults 19–64 outside expansion; SSDI back-pay arrives at award but doesn't compensate the depleted savings during the wait.</p>
