</header>
<p class="neighbor-card__facts">Age 74 · $1,200/month OASDI · subsidized senior housing · minimum SNAP benefit</p>
<p class="neighbor-card__insight">Household-of-1 elderly category. SUA retained under OBBBA given age 60+ status. Net-income test after Standard Deduction and Excess Medical Deduction places benefit at or near the $24 minimum monthly benefit. CSFP commodity box distributed monthly through Philabundance / PCA partner agency. October 2025 federal shutdown's brief SNAP issuance disruption was material for fixed-income elders.</p>
