<p class="neighbor-card__insight">Registered with DBHIDS as the Philadelphia AE. P/FDS Waiver assigned (cost-capped). Individual Support Plan includes supported employment via OVR-and-ODP partnership, day habilitation, respite services. Cost cap means health-and-welfare needs at margin trigger transfer-request to Consolidated / Community Living. OVR Order-of-Selection waitlist may delay supported-employment service start.</p>
